      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MONUMENT (4) lines up here off a comfortable win at Warragul after jumping from box 1 (26.32). Will need some luck early after drawing a tricky box here. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Looks to have an edge on most of these. ZIPPING CHOI (1) steps out for the first time at this track. Last start placegetter off this draw when second (24.35) at Traralgon. Comes through a solid form race last start. Likely to be in the finish again. ELSWYK SID (2) has missed the placings at his last couple but was in the money three back when third (30.26) at this track in a Grade 5. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. STIPULATED (5) should be thereabouts.",
